title: Credits

Mostly Wikipedia was used for the making of the game, but there is also two texts i used for the game:

**The Left Kuomintang - A Definition: by Jerome Ch'en**

https://www.jstor.org/stable/610920

**The Northern Expedition: China's National Revolution of 1926-1928: by Donald A. Jordan**

https://www.jstor.org/content/oa_book_monograph/j.ctv9zck3k

